  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is the time in seconds since midnight Pacific time (PST/PDT), truncated to whole seconds. That is the same as the time of day in SLT expressed as seconds.</p>
  <p>For GMT use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetGMTclock" target="_blank">llGetGMTclock</a></p>
</p>
